        "original_id": "52718b51-c850-512c-8e8a-466b3b945f3f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mick Napier, Stephen Colbert, Tina Fey, Rachel Dratch, Horatio Sanz, Nia Vardalos, Andy Richter, Jeff Garlin, David Sedaris\n- Projects: Splatter Theatre, The Colbert Report, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\n- Places: Cabaret Metro\n- Roles: director, host\n\nFacts:\n- Splatter Theatre was first performed at the Cabaret Metro on October 31, 1987, and Mick Napier directed it.\n- Mick Napier has directed Stephen Colbert, Tina Fey, Rachel Dratch, Horatio Sanz, Nia Vardalos, Andy Richter, Jeff Garlin, and David Sedaris, among others.\n- Stephen Colbert hosted The Colbert Report on Comedy Central from 2005 to 2014.\n- Stephen Colbert began hosting The Late Show with Stephen Colbert on CBS in September 2015.",
